      tagline: 'Your skin barrier is asking for deep, lasting moisture.',\n      desc: 'Your answers reveal skin that isn\\'t just dry on the surface, the deeper barrier is compromised. These formulas work at different layers to restore lasting suppleness from the inside out.',\n      products: [\n        {\n          rank: '01', brand: 'SkinMedica', name: 'HA5®<em> Rejuvenating Hydrator</em>',\n          why: 'Five forms of hyaluronic acid at five different molecular weights, from large molecules that hydrate the surface immediately, to small molecules that penetrate deeper.',\n          keys: ['5 molecular weights of HA', 'Supports skin\\'s natural HA production'],\n          handle: 'skinmedica-ha5®-rejuvenating-hydrator'\n        },\n        {\n          rank: '02', brand: 'SkinCeuticals', name: 'Triple Lipid Restore<em> 2:4:2</em>',\n          why: 'Ceramides, cholesterol, and fatty acids in the 2:4:2 ratio that mirrors the composition of healthy human skin. Rebuilds the lipid matrix.',\n          keys: ['2% ceramides, 4% cholesterol, 2% fatty acids', 'SkinCeuticals study: improved skin smoothness'],\n          handle: 'skinceuticals-triple-lipid-restore-2-4-2'\n        },\n        {\n          rank: '03', brand: 'Hydrinity', name: 'Renewing<em> HA Serum</em>',\n          why: 'Powered by Supercharged Hyaluronic Acid that absorbs deeply to immediately plump skin, optimized at the cellular level.',\n          keys: ['Supercharged HA formulation', 'Botanical extracts defend against environmental stressors'],\n          handle: 'hydrinity-renewing-ha-serum'\n        },\n        {\n          rank: '04', brand: 'Skinbetter Science', name: 'Trio Rebalancing<em> Moisture Treatment</em>',\n          why: 'A triple-action approach targeting the three critical elements of natural skin hydration to bring immense moisture back to a compromised barrier.',\n          keys: ['Patented formulation for barrier hydration', 'Heavy hydration without a heavy feel'],\n          handle: 'skinbetter-science-trio-rebalancing-moisture-treatment'\n        },\n        {\n          rank: '05', brand: 'ZO Skin Health', name: 'Hydrating<em> Creme</em>',\n          why: 'Temporarily protects and helps relieve minor skin irritation and itching while restoring hydration. Perfect for severely dry or post-procedure skin.',\n          keys: ['Zox12® complex for antioxidant defense', 'Colloidal oatmeal soothes itching and redness'],\n          handle: 'zo-hydrating-creme'\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n\n    clarify: {\n      ghost: 'Refine',\n      eyebrow: 'Your Skin Profile',\n      name: ['The', '<em>Refinement Seeker</em>'],\n      tagline: 'Your skin is ready to be truly clear.',\n      desc: 'Congestion, texture, and enlarged pores are a pipeline problem, they require intelligent exfoliation, sebum regulation, and the right actives at the right depth.',\n      products: [\n        {\n          rank: '01', brand: 'SkinCeuticals', name: 'LHA<em> Serum</em>',\n          why: 'A first-to-market acid blend: 0.3% LHA, 1.5% salicylic acid, 3.5% glycolic acid, and 2% dioic acid to smooth texture and address breakouts.',\n          keys: ['LHA + salicylic + glycolic + dioic acid', 'Oil-free, non-comedogenic'],\n          handle: 'lha-serum'\n        },\n        {\n          rank: '02', brand: 'Skinbetter Science', name: 'AlphaRet<em> Clearing Serum</em>',\n          why: 'Combines patented AlphaRet technology (a retinoid and AHA conjugate) with salicylic acid and pore-clearing ingredients to improve clarity.',\n          keys: ['Patented AlphaRet tech + Salicylic Acid', 'Far less irritating than traditional acne regimens'],\n          handle: 'skinbetter-science-alpharet-clearing-serum'\n        },\n        {\n          rank: '03', brand: 'SkinCeuticals', name: 'Silymarin<em> CF</em>',\n          why: 'An oil-free Vitamin C serum tailored specifically for oily and blemish-prone skin. Prevents oil oxidation that leads to breakouts.',\n          keys: ['15% L-Ascorbic Acid + 0.5% Silymarin', 'Reduces oiliness and refines skin texture'],\n          handle: 'skinceuticals-silymarin-cf'\n        },\n        {\n          rank: '04', brand: 'ZO Skin Health', name: 'Complexion Renewal<em> Pads</em>',\n          why: 'Pre-moistened pads loaded with salicylic and glycolic acid. These remove excess surface oil and deeply clean congested pores.',\n          keys: ['Salicylic acid deeply unclogs pores', 'Glycolic acid smooths surface texture'],\n          handle: 'zo-complexion-renewal-pads'\n        },\n        {\n          rank: '05', brand: 'ZO Skin Health', name: 'Dual Action<em> Scrub</em>',\n          why: 'Dual action exfoliation helps remove dead skin cells and excess surface oils that can lead to clogged pores.',\n          keys: ['Physical and chemical exfoliation in one', 'Targeted for acne-prone skin'],\n          handle: 'zo-dual-action-scrub'\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n\n    soothe: {\n      ghost: 'Restore',\n      eyebrow: 'Your Skin Profile',\n      name: ['The', '<em>Sensitive Skin Purist</em>'],\n      tagline: 'Your barrier needs rebuilding before anything else.',\n      desc: 'Reactive, sensitive skin is usually a compromised barrier problem, not an ingredient sensitivity problem. The approach here is to rebuild first, correct later.',\n      products: [\n        {\n          rank: '01', brand: 'Alastin Skincare', name: 'Restorative Skin Complex',\n          why: 'The updated TriHex+ formula includes proprietary peptides to support elastin and collagen. Designed for compromised, reactive skin to clear out old proteins.',\n          keys: ['TriHex Technology supports firmer, smoother-looking skin', 'Tolerated beautifully by compromised skin'],\n          handle: 'alastin-restorative-skin-complex'\n        },\n        {\n          rank: '02', brand: 'Hydrinity', name: 'Restorative<em> HA Serum</em>',\n          why: 'Purpose-engineered for barrier restoration in sensitive skin. Built around deep dermal hydration and